#### [NEW] [pipeline.py](file:///c:/github/academicuniverse.com/academicuniverse/adbg/adbg/core/pipeline.py)
The central orchestrator:

```python
class GenerationPipeline:
    def run(self, config: GenerationConfig) -> DatasetResult:
        """
        1. Initialize SeedManager from config.seed
        2. For each document (1..config.count):
           a. Spawn child seed
           b. Select document type (weighted random)
           c. Select template (weighted random)
           d. Select quality profile (weighted random)
           e. Fabricate data via AcademicDataFabricator
           f. Render clean PDF via generator plugin
           g. Convert PDF to image (Pillow)
           h. Apply degradation pipeline (if profile != CLEAN_PDF)
           i. Export PDF + PNG + JPEG
           j. Build ground truth JSON
           k. Build per-sample metadata
        3. Build manifest.json
        4. Compute dataset statistics
        5. Return DatasetResult
        """
```

