#### [NEW] [tests/test_determinism.py](file:///c:/github/academicuniverse.com/academicuniverse/adbg/tests/test_determinism.py)
**Critical test**: Generates 10 documents with seed=42 twice and asserts byte-identical output:
```python
def test_deterministic_generation():
    result1 = pipeline.run(config(seed=42, count=10))
    result2 = pipeline.run(config(seed=42, count=10))
    
    for doc_id in result1.document_ids:
        assert result1.checksum(doc_id) == result2.checksum(doc_id)
        assert result1.ground_truth(doc_id) == result2.ground_truth(doc_id)
```

