## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
cd adbg
pip install -e ".[dev]"
pytest tests/ -v --tb=short
```

Key assertions:
- **Determinism**: Same seed produces byte-identical outputs (critical)
- **Completeness**: Every document has matching ground truth JSON, metadata JSON, PDF, PNG, JPEG
- **Schema Validity**: All JSON outputs conform to documented schemas
- **Degradation Safety**: No degradation operator produces invalid images (all-black, NaN pixels, wrong dimensions)
- **File Integrity**: SHA-256 checksums in manifest match actual files

### Manual Verification
- Visual inspection of 10 sample documents across all 3 types x 4 quality profiles = 12 combinations
- Verify ground truth JSON fields match visible text in rendered documents
- Confirm CLI works end-to-end: `python generate.py --documents 50 --seed 42 --output ./test_dataset`
- Confirm dataset statistics are accurate

