## Risk Analysis

| Risk | Mitigation |
|:---|:---|
| ReportLab font embedding inconsistency across OS | Use only standard PDF fonts initially; document font requirements |
| OpenCV version incompatibility | Pin `opencv-python-headless>=4.8,<5.0` |
| Degradation non-determinism from float precision | Use `np.float64` throughout; test with `np.allclose` |
| JPEG encoding non-determinism across platforms | Use OpenCV JPEG encoder with explicit quality parameter; document known platform variance |
| Template YAML schema drift | Validate templates against a JSON Schema at load time |
| Large dataset memory pressure | Process documents sequentially; never hold full dataset in memory |

