## Key Design Decisions Summary

| Decision | Choice | Rationale |
|:---|:---|:---|
| Language | Python 3.12+ | Aligns with Document AI research ecosystem |
| PDF Rendering | ReportLab | Specified in tech stack; mature, no system deps |
| Degradation Engine | OpenCV + NumPy | Industry standard for CV operations |
| RNG | NumPy `SeedSequence` | Provably independent child streams |
| Template Format | YAML | No-code extensibility for non-developers |
| Configuration | YAML | Human-readable, supports complex nested structures |
| CLI Framework | Click | Clean, composable, well-documented |
| Plugin Pattern | ABC + Registry | Adding document types requires zero core changes |
| Project Isolation | Standalone `adbg/` directory | Can be extracted to independent repository |
